# Discover report

Written by `numi discover`. It lists what discover found by reading the repository (files only; nothing was executed,
no git, gh or network command was run, and no repository text was followed as an instruction), what the draft in
`.numinance/` chose from it, how far each choice can be trusted, and the result of the self-test. This file carries no
authority; review the documents in `policy/`. Opening the pull request is an operator step that discover does not do.

